  "sourceHash": "005f3866a3c7a55f491ba2cd514774030b9dd099ec7393b86d2711ded93fb0cd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_emporium"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比我想像的輕鬆。我越來越好奇當時切爾諾伯格城裡究竟發生了什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是和這裡一模一樣的事情，只是根紮得更深，燃燒的勢頭更猛。不要大意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我連睡覺都很少闔眼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，我已經儘量速戰速決了，還是對這些店鋪造成了不小的損害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候怕是又要讓魏先生簽帳單，他本來就不那麼喜歡“小姐”她們家的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，舒爾洛夫斯基的水晶，老陳，你是不是挺喜歡這個牌子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還行，他們的吊墜不錯，耳環就沒那麼好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "B1小隊，這裡是陳，徹底封鎖西面入口，降下所有防盜門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很少看你戴耳環。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟一般都穿制服返工，留下幾個衣櫃的衣服放在家裡等蛀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊長官！這裡是整合運動改造過後的大古廣場東L3平面圖，請查閱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辛苦，繼續考察吧，有效利用地形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後我們要找到從這裡出發的最佳路線，穿過整合運動的封鎖區，不能沒有你們的資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "衣服啊......沒想到老陳你竟然會在這上面開銷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是一樣花大筆錢買了多少輛摩托車？衣服這東西，偶爾穿給自己看也沒什麼不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工作佔用了我很多時間，但它畢竟不是我生活的全部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不是每天像鐘錶一樣走進辦公室，還有加班加得其他人嚇到半死，你說的這些話我就都信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能說我們這些當差的，生活還算是過得去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我有時候會想，阿米婭那樣的感染者，還有機會逛街嗎？在這裡買點自己喜歡的飾品，吃點自己喜歡的東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許有。但不是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "C3，這裡是陳，清查一樓，緩速推進，安全優先。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吧。這片大地確實不公平。阿發死了，我卻活了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們都死了，只有我活了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老陳。那條情報是不是真的有價值？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一定有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動術師",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（可，可恨......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動術師",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（至少要把你們在這裡一起埋了......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳Sir！快走！！我們在三樓發現了大量的爆炸物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在你腳下的位置！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動術師",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_wizard",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近衛局，現在就把你們炸上天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老陳！過來！站在盾後面！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "avg_5_5_fall_back"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "腳底？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老陳！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
